*HEADING
Project 05 V2: uniform temperature rise 20 -> 120 degC, minimally constrained (free expansion)
** SI units (m, kg, s, N, Pa), temperatures in degC
*INCLUDE, INPUT=../../mesh/v_n40_z2.inp
*MATERIAL, NAME=TI64
*ELASTIC
113.8E9, 0.33
*EXPANSION, ZERO=20.
8.6E-6
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=PANEL, MATERIAL=TI64
*INITIAL CONDITIONS, TYPE=TEMPERATURE
NALL, 20.
** rigid-body constraints only, on the mid-thickness plane
*BOUNDARY
P_A, 1, 3
P_B, 2, 3
P_C, 3, 3
*STEP
*STATIC
1., 1., 1.E-5, 1.
*TEMPERATURE
NALL, 120.
*NODE PRINT, NSET=P_A
U
*NODE PRINT, NSET=P_B
U
*NODE PRINT, NSET=P_C
U
*NODE PRINT, NSET=P_D
U
*NODE PRINT, NSET=P_CEN
U
*NODE PRINT, NSET=COL_CEN
U
*EL PRINT, ELSET=PANEL
S
*NODE PRINT, NSET=NALL, TOTALS=ONLY
RF
*NODE FILE
U
*EL FILE
S
*END STEP
